{"candidateAnswer":"A couple of musical instruments","evidence":"[D8:12 | 4:29 pm on 21 August, 2023] Tim: Things have been great since we last talked - I've been focusing on school and reading a bunch of fantasy books. It's a nice way to take a break from all the stress. I've also started learning how to play the piano - it's a learning curve, but it's so satisfying seeing the progress I make! Life's good.\n[D21:11 | 5:34 pm on 6 December, 2023] Tim: I'm learning how to play the violin now. I'm mostly into classical music but I'm keen to try out jazz and film scores too. It's a great way to chill and get creative.","itemId":"urn:uuid:924b6516-7460-54a7-bc08-606ce0636cfe","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:90caf78c9a53f026e040e58277c76cd5420fe45772925453308cb1ba63f17d56","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What instruments does Tim play?","referenceAnswer":"piano, violin","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"90caf78c9a53f026e040e58277c76cd5420fe45772925453308cb1ba63f17d56"}}]}